}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/logistics">Logistics</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Analytics</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Logistics Intelligence & Analytics</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Transform raw movement and maintenance data into strategic guidance, identifying 
            inefficiencies and optimizing the economics of your distribution network.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Delivery Efficiency & Performance</h2>
        <p>
            Dive deep into the performance of your delivery operations. Analyze On-Time Delivery 
            (OTD) trends by region, route, and driver. Identify high-friction delivery points 
            that frequently experience delays and understand the root causes—whether due to 
            loading bottlenecks, traffic patterns, or customer-site constraints. This 
            empirical data allows for the continuous refinement of ETAs and route 
            sequencing.
        </p>
        <p>
            Average turnaround times at depots and delivery sites are quantified, 
            identifying opportunities to improve warehouse throughput and driver 
            productivity.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Cost per Kilometer (CPK) Analysis</h2>
        <p>
            Understand the financial drivers of your fleet. The system aggregates all costs—fuel, 
            maintenance, driver labor, and asset depreciation—to calculate an 
            authoritative Cost per Kilometer for every vehicle and fleet class. 
            Comparing these metrics identifies outliers and reveals the most cost-effective 
            vehicle models for specific route profiles, informing future fleet 
            procurement decisions.
        </p>
        <p>
            Fuel variance analysis compares actual consumption against planned benchmarks, 
            rapidly identifying mechanical degradation or behavioral issues that impact 
            organizational profitability.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Utilization & Strategic Planning</h2>
        <p>
            Visualize fleet utilization over time to identify capacity gaps and redundancies. 
            High-fidelity downtime reports show the impact of maintenance and repair on 
            fleet availability, supporting decisions on preventative maintenance budgets 
            and asset replacement cycles. Strategic heat-maps of delivery volume 
            identify emerging growth zones, assisting leadership in planning 
            distribution hubs and regional expansion.
        </p>
        <p>
            Customer satisfaction tracking—correlated with delivery performance data— 
            demonstrates the impact of logistics excellence on customer retention 
            and organizational growth.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
